# Riven Ash

![Riven silhouette sheet](./data/123.png)

Riven is the blade-runner lead of Blood. His visual identity mixes hard geometry with loose fabric motion.

## Design Notes

- Dominant shape: triangle and long diagonals
- Palette: iron blue, bruised red, ash white
- Signature prop: fractured blade lantern

> The silhouette must read from a distance before any detail is visible.
